    "text": "def is_prime(n):\n    \"\"\"Return True if a given number is prime, and False otherwise.\n    >>> is_prime(6)\n    False\n    >>> is_prime(101)\n    True\n    >>> is_prime(11)\n    True\n    >>> is_prime(13441)\n    True\n    >>> is_prime(61)\n    True\n    >>> is_prime(4)\n    False\n    >>> is_prime(1)\n    False\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return False\n    if n == 2:\n        return True\n    for i in 2:\n        if i * i  + 1 <= n:\n            if n % i == 0:\n                return False\n    return True",
